  "notes": [
    "steady_requests_per_s leaves out the first 30 s and the last window: a held poll is counted when it answers, so a waiting run's first 30 s undercount.",
    "The first 1,000-worker waiting run had 49 held polls (0.7%) end in a client-side ReadError, all in its last 50 s; the repeat, tailed with wrangler tail --status error --status canceled, had none and one edge 502. The tail recorded no failed Worker invocation, only canceled Own invocations when the client abandoned held polls at shutdown. Every created task was consumed in every run.",
    "The redeploy uploaded the same 0.4.0 bundle and took 17 s; no held poll failed or was answered wait_refused. It did not replace the running code, so it does not exercise a Durable Object reset.",
    "Not measured: Durable Object duration billing, which needs the Cloudflare dashboard or analytics API."
